STATEMENT: >>>
The product specification shall list the Tower CSCI artifacts delivered in this version: the Erlang modules and tests under apps/atc_tower, the example airport file config/example-airport.toml, the TLA+ specification specs/tla/AtcTower.tla with specs/tla/AtcTower.cfg, the refinement mapping specs/refinement/Mapping.md, and the StrictDoc sources under reqs. The mapping's open obligations remain open. Acceptance is a reader finding each of those paths in the version that this specification describes.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The product specification is the inventory of what the version contains after the build and the model exist.
<<<
